<HEAD>PART 4231&#x2014;MERGERS AND TRANSFERS BETWEEN MULTIEMPLOYER PLANS
</HEAD>
<AUTH>
<HED>Authority:</HED><PSPACE>29 U.S.C. 1302(b)(3)
</PSPACE></AUTH>
<SOURCE>
<HED>Source:</HED><PSPACE>83 FR 46653, Sept. 14, 2018, unless otherwise noted.
